Error: Jet.PrivateItem: `IOOperation` is private to its module
  --> Tests/UI/core_io_operation_user.jet:2:21
    |
  2 | user: fn(operation: IOOperation) {}
    |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A `priv module` is usable only by its enclosing module (`priv(package)`: by its package), and a `priv` field only by its type's module
 Fix: Use `IOOperation` from inside its module, or remove `priv` from its module or field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.PrivateItem
